For each orbit O_i we give the following orbitwise invariants:

with v any vertex belonging to O_i,

the incidence Icd_i : the number of facets containing v
the adjacency Adj_i : the number of vertices forming an edge with v
Adj_{i,delta}       : the number of cuts forming an edge with v 
|O_i|               : the size of the orbit O_i

-------------------- orbitwise invariants -------------------------

i          Icd_i         Adj_i         |O_i|          Adj_{i,delta}

1          30            25            16             15
2          10            10            16             10
-------------------------------------------------------------------


++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
The orbits are ordered first by decreasing incidence Icd_i, then by 
decreasing adjacency Adj_i and then by increasing orbitsize |O_i|
++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
